  "transcript": "Welcome to my bookshelf!\n\nEach book represents a part of my education. There’s the University of Skövde, the University of Tartu, Lexicon, Komvux, and my gymnasium education in Estonia.\n\nThere are also some loose papers representing standalone courses in art, design, and three-dimensional modelling.\n\nWhich would you like to hear about?\n\nSay “Skövde,” “Tartu,” “Lexicon,” “Komvux,” “gymnasium,” or “standalone courses.”",
